get.summary:
Cron job endpoint to process pending check-backs
Should be called by Vercel Cron or external scheduler

To set up in vercel.json:
{
  "crons": [{
    "path": "/api/analytics/check-backs/process",
    "schedule": "0 6 * * *"
  }]
}

